==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Silver Tempest|Toxapex|115}} from the {{TCG|Silver Tempest}} expansion; both cards have the Venoshock attack.
*{{m|Venoshock}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Toxapex}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

